EVENT DATE AND TIME:         October 19, 1977, at 7:30 a.m.
             Observed the passage of    "Light,"    which was at the height of the    trees
a little ahead of his residence the "object" reduced the light intensity, turning into a    tiny focus             (compared to a burning cigarette);
he states that after a slight stop, the "device" emitted three rapid and consecutive flashes like a car headlight in the direction of the city;
